DND_MERCHANTHEADER	=	"\c[A3]Bernabe \cj\"\c[06]DRX\cj\" \c[A3]Santiago";
DND_MRCHT_GREET		=	"Greetings weary traveller! I carry with me some shiny valuables and am willing to part with them for some coin! Take a look, you won't be disappointed.";

DND_MRCHT_HOVER_LOWLEVELARMOR	=	"Well, what can I say? You look really high level but I'm convinced you could use this perfectly good armor right here! I think it's got your name on it too...";
DND_MRCHT_HOVER_LOWLEVELCHARM	=	"Look, I know what you're thinking... This one doesn't look good, dogshit even... Well, I found it in the trashcan yesterday. I still think it can be of use to you however! Special discount!";

DND_MRCHT_HOVER_HIGHLEVELITEM1	=	"Woah buddy! Slow down, I don't think you're quite ready to equip this one. Maybe one day, right? For now though, perhaps it can collect some dust?";
DND_MRCHT_HOVER_HIGHLEVELITEM2	=	"I believe this one is out of your league at the moment pal but hey, dream big and maybe one day you'll win big, right?";

DND_MRCHT_DOOMGUY_CANTAFFORD	=	"Oh man, it sure looks like you performed an execution on your bank account...";

DND_MRCHT_MARINE_CANTAFFORD		=	"Maybe you could try rocket jumping into a bank account huh? Don't break your legs though, you don't look like you can afford the hospital bills...";

DND_MRCHT_HOBO_CANTAFFORD		=	"No wonder you play Hobo, you're a broke ass motherfucker!";

DND_MRCHT_WANDERER_CANTAFFORD1	=	"I guess you don't own the Heretic & Hexen Remaster either huh... Too bad, you could fare better there!";
DND_MRCHT_WANDERER_CANTAFFORD2	=	"Aww poor baby... Did D'sparil steal your lunch money? Maybe go ask daddy Corvus for some pocket change.";

DND_MRCHT_TRICKSTER_CANTAFFORD	=	"Let me guess, all your money went to catnip? No? Then it's the breast implants, definitely...";

DND_MRCHT_ORBOFSIN1				=	"99% of the travellers abandon before locking a good attribute on their items... I offer you this \cfOrb of Sin\c- to you with a special Bernabe discount, just this once!";